# Native Select

Native Select presents a compact list of choices while retaining browser default behavior.

Options can be grouped using `{ label, options: [...] }` entries. Grouping retains native keyboard and form behavior.

Set `multiple` and bind `values` for multi-select. This uses a native listbox, so the form submits one entry per selected option.

Use `optional` to identify fields that are not required.

